{"2229900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chimera CUSTOM XG", "steam_appid": 2229900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/3a4162ef49da833bcf0e2007781fed7a.avif?t=1780938873\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens have finally invaded, loud, mean, and not here for us. Earth has been scorched, defenses are obliterated, but the war isn’t over. What are the invaders after?<br><br>You are a C.U.S.T.O.M. soldier, engineered with the perfect balance of strength, aggression, and stupidity. Fuse with Animal Genetics, load up on high tech weaponry, and run throat first into danger.<br><br>Blast your way through sewer scum in New Los Angeles to the bloodied snows in Antarctica and more! Which timeline will bring forth the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/3cc3455958a0e109bcacd7404379303c.poster.avif?t=1780938873\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/3cc3455958a0e109bcacd7404379303c.webm?t=1780938873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/3cc3455958a0e109bcacd7404379303c.mp4?t=1780938873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/6450b8d86a21a49a8589a6c39bcbe2fe.avif?t=1780938873\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear waves, choose mutations, and morph your DNA to the extreme! Stack damage, hoard HP, size up your bullets, and more. Special gene augments crank your Animal Genetics to their evolutionary breaking point.<br><br>High-speed nuanced twin-stick action with melee, dodging, grenade cooking, animal DNA, and endless augment combos. Every button counts and every move has teeth.<br><br>Whatever keeps you alive is allowed, despite what Geneva says.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/92cb8dcff940f9783883d8c0f0992959.poster.avif?t=1780938873\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/92cb8dcff940f9783883d8c0f0992959.webm?t=1780938873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/92cb8dcff940f9783883d8c0f0992959.mp4?t=1780938873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/e01bfbbadd0f4dcaad64189145573b73.avif?t=1780938873\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod your weapons on the fly, pick the affix that fits your attitude, and become the problem. Master the Animal Power that accentuates your playstyle, because destruction should be custom-tailored.<br><br>On your missions through space and time, perfect your genetic signature until you’re a walking war crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229900/extras/a9932b19c1768adfb3a6e4332fe52717.poster.avif?t=1780938873\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https